ht=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-sparkles\"><path d=\"M9.937 15.5A2 2 0 0 0 8.5 14.063l-6.135-1.582a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.962L8.5 9.936A2 2 0 0 0 9.937 8.5l1.582-6.135a.5.5 0 0 1 .963 0L14.063 8.5A2 2 0 0 0 15.5 9.937l6.135 1.581a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .964L15.5 14.063a2 2 0 0 0-1.437 1.437l-1.582 6.135a.5.5 0 0 1-.963 0z\"></path><path d=\"M20 3v4\"></path><path d=\"M22 5h-4\"></path><path d=\"M4 17v2\"></path><path d=\"M5 18H3\"></path></svg><span><b>Conteúdo</b><small>Variações por canal</small></span></div><div class=\"flow-step\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-send\"><path d=\"M14.536 21.686a.5.5 0 0 0 .937-.024l6.5-19a.496.496 0 0 0-.635-.635l-19 6.5a.5.5 0 0 0-.024.937l7.93 3.18a2 2 0 0 1 1.112 1.11z\"></path><path d=\"m21.854 2.147-10.94 10.939\"></path></svg><span><b>Publicação</b><small>Aprovação, fila e acompanhamento</small></span></div></div></section><section id=\"como-funciona\" class=\"public-section\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">COMO FUNCIONA</span><h2>Do produto à divulgação, sem complicação.</h2><div class=\"feature-grid\"><article><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-package-search\"><path d=\"M21 10V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l2-1.14\"></path><path d=\"m7.5 4.27 9 5.15\"></path><polyline points=\"3.29 7 12 12 20.71 7\"></polyline><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"22\" y2=\"12\"></line><circle cx=\"18.5\" cy=\"15.5\" r=\"2.5\"></circle><path d=\"M20.27 17.27 22 19\"></path></svg><h3>1. Organize produtos</h3><p>Centralize produtos e seus links de afiliado em um catálogo monitorado.</p></article><article><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chart-column\"><path d=\"M3 3v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16\"></path><path d=\"M18 17V9\"></path><path d=\"M13 17V5\"></path><path d=\"M8 17v-3\"></path></svg><h3>2. Avalie oportunidades</h3><p>Use informações disponíveis e verificáveis para priorizar o que merece atenção.</p></article><article><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clapperboard\"><path d=\"M20.2 6 3 11l-.9-2.4c-.3-1.1.3-2.2 1.3-2.5l13.5-4c1.1-.3 2.2.3 2.5 1.3Z\"></path><path d=\"m6.2 5.3 3.1 3.9\"></path><path d=\"m12.4 3.4 3.1 4\"></path><path d=\"M3 11h18v8a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2Z\"></path></svg><h3>3. Prepare campanhas</h3><p>Crie rascunhos específicos para cada canal e revise antes de publicar.</p></article></div></section><section id=\"recursos\" class=\"public-section public-accent\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">UMA OPERAÇÃO CENTRALIZADA</span><h2>Menos tarefas manuais. Mais controle sobre cada campanha.</h2><p>O Affiliate Intelligence está sendo desenvolvido para conectar marketplaces, conteúdo e canais sociais preservando a rastreabilidade das informações.</p></div><div class=\"mini-features\"><span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-link2\"><path d=\"M9 17H7A5 5 0 0 1 7 7h2\"></path><path d=\"M15 7h2a5 5 0 1 1 0 10h-2\"></path><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"16\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line></svg> Links de afiliado</span><span><svg xmlns